From c3352854be995d20cedef76b085c6dde3d7e1ebf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pm-official-id <pm-official-id@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:07:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Same-to-same style layouts, three app players, dropdown
 picker

Each ArchiveTune style now renders its real structure instead of one
parameterized layout: Little is typography-first (huge bold title, small
art with progress across it at the bottom), Immersive/Immersive Extended
are full-bleed artwork under a scrim with black disc buttons and an info
line (Extended), Material Extended washes the screen in the artwork
behind a tinted rounded control container, Editorial sets a big title
over a scrolling metadata line with sharp-cornered art, Classic is the
traditional centered stack. Three new players join the set: Apple Music
(large rounded art, outline transport, secondary actions, volume slider,
up-next bar), SimpMusic (Material 3, square art, heart, tonal controls)
and BitChord (artwork wash behind a glass card with thin white
controls). The chips picker becomes a dropdown. Build 1002.
